  ```rust
  if !recipe_exists(&recipe_id) { return HttpResponse::NotFound().finish(); }
  ```
- **Limit Input Length**: Set maximum length constraints on user inputs (e.g., title, ingredients, comments) to prevent buffer overflow and excessive data storage. For example:
  ```rust
  if recipe.title.len() > 255 { return HttpResponse::BadRequest().finish(); }
  ```

